{"synopsis":"Seorang sosiopat gila, Monster yang memakai kulit manusia, Iblis dari garis depan utara, dan Eksekutor yang menyeringai.\n\nAku harus bersikap layaknya seperti Julian, Karakter bermata-rubah gila yang ditakuti oleh seluruh kekaisaran.\n\n[Character Trait <Formal Speech>]\n\nAnda berbicara dengan formal kepada semua orang tanpa memandang usia.\n\n\"Bukannya sah-sah saja kalau aku bicara dengan diriku sendiri?\"","alternative_title":"완벽한 실눈 악역을 연기하다","author":"Spring and Autumn","artist":"80","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"0dd139aa-fd41-41dd-a403-710a8968e433","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2026-03-09","released":"2026-03-09"},{"chapter_id":"448ea534-56dc-42b9-9508-ee71583d6a70","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-03-09","released":"2026-03-09"},{"chapter_id":"2e446892-438b-46fa-9791-15d6a0a43174","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-03-09","released":"2026-03-09"},{"chapter_id":"824d26e4-f404-4c3b-b97f-8cc2a5afe388","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2026-02-01","released":"2026-02-01"},{"chapter_id":"951b736e-80f9-4ca0-a26b-1d331b7bed28","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2026-01-18","released":"2026-01-18"},{"chapter_id":"e6fbeafd-9eef-4139-af53-490314df723f","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-01-12","released":"2026-01-12"},{"chapter_id":"b85b4cc5-9d09-4b12-89eb-b8e39c9d75ea","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-01-12","released":"2026-01-12"},{"chapter_id":"0958b870-1192-4b8c-9693-4c062b20ff9f","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2026-01-01","released":"2026-01-01"},{"chapter_id":"98032a86-4abf-4d87-adbd-eec074024ed4","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":"2026-01-01","released":"2026-01-01"},{"chapter_id":"eba75d01-40b7-4549-9e6d-3d9e4d83b0c0","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"","date":"2025-12-22","released":"2025-12-22"},{"chapter_id":"b8390c78-c629-46f1-b499-ff9262d60c4a","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"","date"